<PolicyLayout title="Terms of Use" description="Practical information about using The Curious Brain Toolkit website and its external links.">
  <p>This website introduces printable resources for adults who support children aged 8–11. You may browse the pages and follow their links for general information about the resources and where to purchase them.</p>

  <h2>Resources and professional judgement</h2>
  <p>Descriptions on this site are intended to explain the materials, not to assess an individual child or replace advice from a professional who knows the child and their circumstances. Adults should use their judgement about whether a resource is suitable and how to introduce it.</p>

  <h2>Purchases and external services</h2>
  <p>Purchases take place on Etsy, not through this website. Before buying, review the information shown on the listing and Etsy’s terms. External websites are operated independently, and their content and privacy practices may change.</p>

  <h2>Using printable resources</h2>
  <p>Use permissions vary by resource. Check the individual Etsy listing or ask the seller before copying, sharing or using a resource with a group. This website does not set general school or organisation licence terms.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For questions about a listing or resource, contact the seller through the Curious Brain Etsy shop.</p>
</PolicyLayout>
